| session_type | text not null default 'wallet' | `wallet` \| `email` \| `reset` \| `otp` |
| nonce | text | SIWE nonce, reset token, or OTP code |
| otp_purpose | text | `verify_email` \| `sign_in` \| `password_reset` when `session_type='otp'` |
